 is relabelled a per-chunk execution.\",\n    \"D062 selects changed-flow coverage. Original P09/P10 results and owner standing are unchanged; no old artifact is claimed byte-identical to the new candidate.\",\n    \"No new live calls or actual remote warning diagnosis. Stable installed acceptance and Linux platform qualification remain separate.\",\n    \"controller_complete:false; actual review receipts supplement the historical ledger without fabricated standard-controller completion.\"\n  ]\n}\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"Prisma AIRS Desktop v2 independent review verdict\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"request_id\",\n    \"attempt_id\",\n    \"subject\",\n    \"fingerprints\",\n    \"scores\",\n    \"required_fixes\",\n    \"blockers\",\n    \"evidence_gaps\",\n    \"optional_suggestions\",\n    \"limitations\",\n    \"inspected_files\",\n    \"recommendation\"\n  ],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"request_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"attempt_id\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"subject\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Chunk C01-C49 or phase P01-P11 under review\"\n    },\n    \"fingerprints\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"source\",\n        \"dependencies\",\n        \"build_flags\",\n        \"evidence\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"source\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"dependencies\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"build_flags\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"evidence\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"scores\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"architecture\",\n        \"behavior\",\n        \"authority_security\",\n        \"validation\",\n        \"overall\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"architecture\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 10\n        },\n        \"behavior\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 10\n        },\n        \"authority_security\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 10\n        },\n        \"validation\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 10\n        },\n        \"overall\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 10\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"required_fixes\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"blockers\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"evidence_gaps\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"optional_suggestions\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"limitations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"inspected_files\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"string\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"recommendation\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"pass\",\n        \"fail\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
